Source: https://docs.z.ai/guides/overview/pricing (promo rates for glm-5.3-flash until 2026-09-09 UTC+8)

|| Model           | Cache hit | Cache miss | Output ||
|| --------------- | --------- | ---------- | ------ ||
|| `glm-5.3`       | $0.26     | $1.40      | $4.40  ||
|| `glm-5.3-flash` | $0.015    | $0.075     | $0.25  ||

> **GLM Coding Plan billing is points-based**, not per-token. The USD/MTok
> table above converts multipliers (glm-5.3: input 6.9, cached 1.7, output 24;
> glm-5.3-flash: input 2.3, cached 0.56, output 8 per 10k tokens) at 1 USD =
